{"version":1,"key":"card:90","content":{"id":90,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"cd","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示 change directory，它的作用是用来切换工作目录的，它的基本使用如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5871c100-cfe2-4e36-bcb2-d9effdb867eb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"cd dir","collabId":"25fc556d-e83b-4b88-9d84-3f6dca975242","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"8ce7fad2-a2bf-45c8-812a-20725066a66e","language":"bash","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"2a5e156c-2a16-4c95-8149-bfaf6368205b"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"dir","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是一个路径，它可以是相对路径，也可以是绝对路径","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8519eabe-5380-4bb3-a872-8e4006997a56","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"# 切换到 /tmp 目录\n~ » cd /tmp\n/tmp » ls\nmath  tmpscfytyzt  tmux-1000\n# 切换到工作目录下的 math 目录\n/tmp » cd math\n/tmp/math » ls\nadd  add.c","collabId":"ef167994-c5d0-46c1-8958-37de5a43c1ca","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"8c6cfeb9-d91f-4940-859f-782465da6649","language":"bash","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"37efae59-1292-41d9-bf43-7f3174bfde71"},{"children":[{"text":"在 Linux 中有几个特别的目录，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"~","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示用户的家目录，因此通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"cd ~","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 可以切换到家目录，或者直接使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"cd","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 命令，不指定任何的路径也可以直接切换到家目录。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"68e4745b-2b14-4eaf-b593-aca773486a65","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"# 切换到家目录\ncd ~\n# 不指定任何路径，也表示切换到家目录\ncd","collabId":"d9683da8-3f43-4a26-aa78-6cb2a1f84859","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b92ee130-ee09-4f55-aa61-7ac2707b39f8","language":"bash","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"8397b2d6-7da1-4c95-87db-16459d9f81f6"},{"children":[{"text":"还有两个特殊的目录，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":".","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示当前目录，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"..","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示上一级目录，在每个目录中都有这两个特殊目录，这两个目录都是隐藏目录，可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"ls -a","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 命令查看隐藏文件","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dc154c8c-3b86-4c99-bff8-5a92efeabef5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"~ » ls -a\n.              .cache      .local           .sudo_as_admin_successful       hello\n..             .conda      .motd_shown      .viminfo                        hello.c\n.Xauthority    .condarc    .oh-my-zsh       .zcompdump                      math\n.bash_history  .config     .profile         .zcompdump-DESKTOP-PUSQM6M-5.8\n.bash_logout   .landscape  .python_history  .zsh_history\n.bashrc        .lesshst    .ssh             .zshrc","collabId":"4a300317-d07b-4016-a1e3-cf278f910fc7","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"1270167c-be23-4883-9420-ed29a9bee2d9","language":"bash","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"29d7887a-3ca3-4845-a2b2-957e36f929d3"},{"children":[{"text":"一般我们在进行移动，拷贝操作的情况下使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":".","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，将一些文件移动或拷贝到当前目录下；我们一般使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"cd ..","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 来回到上级目录。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f5930c6b-8a7a-4f46-adf2-e8ab60e5f77b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"cd","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 命令还有一个特殊的用法，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"cd -","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 可以回到上次所在的目录","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d9c50a03-204b-4b1d-aa62-7f3a62be5910","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"# 当前目录为家目录\n~ » ls\nhello  hello.c  math\n# 切换到 /tmp 目录\n~ » cd /tmp\n# 回到上次所在的目录，也就是家目录\n/tmp » cd -\n~\n~ » ls\nhello  hello.c  math","collabId":"f3c335b6-26ef-466f-b582-46b01e08832e","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"38cd50d4-83c1-468d-b6cb-4f98a49c528a","language":"bash","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"32904c18-8824-403c-abb8-ac88adf71d5c"}],"collabId":"d0662ea1-aae4-4eb0-854e-ab72646f1f8f","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"}],"tags":["Linux/命令/cd"],"createTime":1689173895871,"updateTime":1793532516751,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532516751}}